Keep a shared source as empty text.
Keep a shared smalls as empty text.
Keep a shared bigs as empty text.
Keep a shared cleaned as an empty list of text.
Keep a shared mapped as empty text.
To seek from spot (a whole number).
If spot is more than 25, return.
The piece is the slice of smalls from spot to spot plus 1.
If piece matches mapped, set mapped to the slice of bigs from spot to spot plus 1, return.
Seek from spot plus 1.

To convert from spot (a whole number).
If spot is more than the last position of source, return.
The piece is the slice of source from spot to spot plus 1.
Set mapped to piece.
If piece does not match "-", seek from 0.
If piece does not match "-", Place mapped into cleaned.
Convert from spot plus 1.

Place "5F3Z-2e-9-w" into source.
Place "abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz" into smalls.
Place "ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ" into bigs.
Convert from 0.
The width is 4.
The size is one more than the last position of cleaned.
The firstsize is size modulo width.
The limit is width.
If firstsize is more than 0, set limit to firstsize.
The formatted is an empty list of text.
The used is 0.
The final is the last position of cleaned.
For every spot from 0 to final.
If used is limit and used is more than 0, Place "-" into formatted, set used to 0, set limit to width.
Place item spot of cleaned into formatted.
Add 1 to used.

The result is join formatted with "".
Show result.
